# Build context of the web image (deploy/web/Dockerfile builds from the repository root; the API image uses
# backend/ and its own .dockerignore). Only the frontend sources and the Nginx files go in: never the local
# node_modules (built for this machine's OS, and huge), build output, test artefacts or secrets.
*
!frontend
!deploy/web
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
